## How This Works

- Add tasks using: `- [ ] Description ➕ YYYY-MM-DD 📅 YYYY-MM-DD`
- Priority (optional): place between description and ➕ - 🔺 Highest, ⏫ High, 🔼 Medium, 🔽 Low, ⏬ Lowest
- ➕ = created date. 📅 = due date (omit if no deadline). Priority emoji is optional.
- Status: `- [ ]` not started, `- [/]` in progress, `- [x]` done, `- [-]` cancelled
- When done (`- [x]`), completed tasks move to [[Archive]] with `✅ YYYY-MM-DD`.
- The Tasks plugin reads all emoji metadata natively - filtering, sorting, and urgency scoring all work.

